1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Meet ShopNearMe: one product search for online delivery, nearby pickup, and second-hand offers.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:20,000
The home screen stays focused on the task. Recent searches drive useful recommendations instead of random suggestions.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:42,000
The OpenStreetMap location picker searches only after an explicit action. Select a result or click the map; the address and coordinates persist.

4
00:00:42,000 --> 00:01:00,000
A broad clock search returns live models, store imagery, availability, and verified totals that include shipping.

5
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Product-specific filters narrow the results, and the custom menu sorts by lowest or highest total price.

6
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Five WebMCP tools let agents search, read results, set location, filter, and sort through the same state as the human interface.

7
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:53,000
ShopNearMe makes shopping research understandable for people and actionable for their agents.
